Tag name: noresm3_0_beta19
Date: 07.06.2026
One-line Summary: Updates to CDEPS, CAM, CLM

Details:
clm:
  - update to ctsm5.4.042_noresm_v0 (will change answers)
  - new compsets for NorESM:
  - NorESM specific compsets start with NI*
  - new xml variable CLM_ESM_DEFAULTS that is used to set defaults to NorESM or CESM
  - component modifier for CLM is now additive.
  - new component modifiers: %FATES-NCFB (fates no-comp, fixed biogeo), %NORESM (brings noresm defaults)
  - some of the previous modifiers were split (f.e. %NOANTHRO, %CMIP6DECK, etc)
  - new bgc_mode options in CLM_BLD_NML_OPTS: fates_ncfb, fates_sp
  - clm now searches for finidat with fates in defaults through fates_finidat variable in namelist_defaults
     - you don't need to specify this, for your initial data to get picked up in the user_nl_clm use finidat
  - fates:
    - update to api46
    - removed fates-sp usermod, history is now switch of by hlm_use_fates_sp
    - fix for H20 balance error in historical runs
    - Patch fusion fix.
cam:
  - update to noresm3_0_035_cam6_4_121
    - cmip7 defaults updates
    - align CAM NF compset aliases with NorESM CMIP7 names
  - update to noresm3_0_036_cam6_4_121
    - tuning of aerosol optical depth by increasing the
      sensitivity of optical depth to relative humidity.
  - update to noresm3_0_037_cam6_4_121
    - update components checkout for stand-alone.
    - update NF compsets to work with new clm ones.
cism:
  - cismwrap_2_2_007_noresm_v7
  - Fix log unit assignment so CISM output goes to glc.log
ccs_config:
  - update to ccs_config_noresm70
    - restore Olivia GNU settings to ccs_config_noresm68
cdeps:
  - update to escomp:cdeps.1.0.94:
    - update for how co2diag is read and written to cplhist
    - Brings CRUJRA2024b to make ifx happy
cmeps:
  - update to escomp:cmeps1.1.41
share:
  - update to escomp:share1.1.20

mosart:
  - bugfixes for Faxa_rofi
  - bugfix for non-h2o tracers restarts

